          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.75,
          "end": 71.76,
          "en": "because we'll have to change the entire logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.76,
          "end": 75.033,
          "en": "of our posts list component and how it works soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.77,
          "end": 78.873,
          "en": "So for the moment, if I save it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.86,
